  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "SUMMER 2026 NOW OPEN FOR BOOKING! WEEKS MAY 30-AUG 8 ARE SATURDAY ARRIVAL/SATURDAY DEPARTURE ONLY. Questions: please do not hesitate to message us. Stay at THE VERANDA ON 30A, a luxury coastal retreat perfectly positioned between Rosemary Beach and Alys Beach—two of the most sought-after destinations along Scenic Highway 30A. This beautifully designed 4-bedroom, 4.5-bath home offers expansive porches, a stunning rooftop deck, and a private nature trail just steps from Rosemary’s charming town center. Thoughtfully created for connection and comfort, the home sleeps up to 11 guests and blends stylish interiors with effortless indoor-outdoor living. Perfect for bachelorette weekends, girls’ trips, and unforgettable family vacations,, The Veranda features open gathering spaces, serene bedroom suites, and multiple outdoor areas ideal for morning coffee, sunset cocktails, and late-night conversations under the stars. Guests enjoy private beach access, with chair and umbrella rentals available, making beach days seamless and stress-free. After a day in the sun, return to a fully stocked home that includes a gourmet coffee bar and all everyday essentials so you can settle in and relax from the moment you arrive. Located just minutes from 30A’s best dining, boutiques, bike paths, and beaches, The Veranda on 30A offers the perfect balance of luxury, convenience, and laid-back coastal charm—designed for making memories that last long after the trip ends.",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
